  "content_html": "<h1>hi honey</h1>\n<p class=\"momentDate\">c. 2024</p>\n<div data-docs-catalogue-ref=\"c1\"><figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--full-column\" data-docs-content-detail=\"media\" data-docs-media-kind=\"catalogue-work\" data-docs-media-id=\"04653\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"docsViewer__mediaImageLink docsViewerFigure__imageLink\" data-docs-media-open aria-label=\"Open hi honey\"><img data-docs-media-image src=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04653-primary-800.webp?v=1\" srcset=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04653-primary-800.webp?v=1 800w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04653-primary-1200.webp?v=1 1200w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04653-primary-1600.webp?v=1 1600w\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"hi honey\" width=\"1600\" height=\"3299\" decoding=\"async\"><span data-docs-media-placeholder hidden>hi honey</span></button></figure></div>\n<pre class=\"moment-text\">\nHi honey\ni’m home\nhope all is well\n \ndoes being lonely\nmean that I’m alone?\n \nis this the right way?\ndoes anyone here\nknow how to read a map?\n \ni see meaning\nin the slightest things\ni have no idea what they mean\n \nthen I realise…\ni’m staring at random dots\n</pre>\n",
